---
// Landing page. Astro + Tailwind. StoryBrand structure: a small business owner
// (the hero) with a problem meets Earl (the guide), who gives a plan and a call
// to action, with the stakes of success and failure made clear. Copy, analytics,
// structured data, and links preserved from the original. Presentation is a full
// warm-and-dramatic overhaul. Built to web/dist/index.html, served by Express.
---
