<body class="bg-bg font-ui text-ink2 antialiased">

<!-- NAV -->
<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-line/70 bg-bg/85 backdrop-blur">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5 sm:px-8">
    <a href="/" class="font-data text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-ink2">EARL</a>
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
      <a href="/newsletter" class="hidden font-data text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-ink/70 transition hover:text-ink2 sm:inline">Newsletter</a>
      <a href="/login" id="nav-auth-link" class="rounded-md border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 font-data text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-ink/80 transition hover:border-ink hover:text-ink2">Sign In</a>
      <a href="/intake" class="rounded-md bg-ink2 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-data text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-bg transition hover:bg-ink">Start free</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line/70" id="hero">
  <canvas id="hero-canvas"></canvas>
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] md:py-28 lg:py-32">
    <div>
      <div class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-white/50 px-3 py-1 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-golddark backdrop-blur">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold"></span> For the small business owner
      </div>
      <h1 class="kinetic mb-6 text-fluid-4xl font-bold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink2">Nobody warned you about the other eighteen jobs.</h1>
      <p class="mb-9 max-w-lg text-fluid-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">You started this to do more of what you love. Being great at your craft and running a business turn out to be two different skills. Earl is here for the owner still trying to find the way back to why they started.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/intake" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gold px-8 py-4 font-data text-sm tracking-[0.06em] text-dark shadow-xl shadow-gold/25 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-golddark hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-gold/30">
          Start the free interview
          <span class="transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="font-data text-sm tracking-[0.04em] text-ink/70 underline decoration-gold/50 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-ink2">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 font-data text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.02em] text-ink/45">One-time payment. Six months of full access. No recurring billing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal relative order-first md:order-none">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/60 shadow-2xl shadow-ink2/15 ring-1 ring-ink2/5">
        <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="Small business owner overwhelmed by decisions, papers, and late nights." class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover object-[center_top] md:aspect-auto md:h-[460px]" />
      </div>
      <!-- Floating product peek -->
      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-4 hidden w-64 rotate-[-2deg] rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-4 shadow-2xl shadow-ink2/20 sm:block md:-left-8">
        <div class="font-data text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-golddark">Navigation Chart</div>
        <div class="mt-1 font-data text-[0.5rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/45">Kill Risk</div>
        <div class="text-[0.8rem] font-medium leading-snug text-ink2">You are the only one who can sell right now, and you do not want to.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE PROBLEM -->
<section class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:py-28" id="problem">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-reading">
    <div class="reveal space-y-6 text-fluid-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      <p>Nobody warned you about this part. Not the work itself, which you were always good at, but the weight of everything that comes with owning the business that does the work.</p>
      <p>You did not sign up to be a manager, an accountant, a salesperson, and a strategist on top of the thing you actually came here to do. You signed up because you were good at something and believed that skill was enough to build a life around. The business was supposed to be the vehicle. Somewhere it became the destination.</p>
      <p>The advice that exists for people in your position was built for someone else. Courses want you to scale. Coaches want you to think like a CEO. Books assume you have a team executing while you strategize. None of that is what you are dealing with. What you are dealing with is this: the decisions that will shape the next three years get made in five minutes, alone, on a gut feeling, with no one to think them through with.</p>
    </div>
    <blockquote class="reveal mt-10 border-l-4 border-gold pl-6 text-fluid-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink2">
      That is what wears people down. Not the work. The isolation of it.
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE GUIDE -->
<section class="border-y border-line bg-white px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center">
      <div class="relative mx-auto mb-7 w-28">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 translate-x-2 translate-y-2 rounded-full bg-gold/30"></div>
        <img src="/assets/earl.png" alt="Earl" class="h-28 w-28 rounded-full border border-line object-cover object-[center_top] shadow-lg" />
      </div>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-fluid-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink2">A mentor's judgment, a machine's memory.</h2>
      <p class="text-fluid-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">A good mentor has lived it and asks the question you are avoiding. An AI holds every book ever written and never gets tired. Earl is what you get when the judgment of the first meets the memory of the second.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Split comparison -->
    <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-line shadow-2xl shadow-ink2/10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="bg-dark p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="mb-6 font-data text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#8a7f72]">On your own</div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-[#b3aaa0]">
          <li>A blank chat box that waits for you to already know the right question.</li>
          <li>A consultant at $150 to $400 who forgets half of it by the next meeting.</li>
          <li>Advice built for someone with a team, not for the work you actually do.</li>
          <li>The decisions that shape the next three years, made in five minutes, alone.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-card p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="mb-6 font-data text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-golddark">With Earl in your corner</div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-gold"></span>He learns your business in full before he says a word about it.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-gold"></span>He remembers everything from every conversation for six months.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-gold"></span>Answers drawn from every serious book ever written on surviving in business.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-gold"></span>Someone who knows your whole situation every time a decision comes up.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BUILT FROM (author marquee) -->
<section class="overflow-hidden border-b border-line bg-bg py-12">
  <div class="mb-7 px-5 text-center font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-golddark">Built from the people who have actually done it</div>
  <div class="marquee-mask relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="flex w-max animate-marquee items-center gap-12 whitespace-nowrap will-change-transform">
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Mike Michalowicz</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Will Guidara</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Chris Voss</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Peter Thiel</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Simon Sinek</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Dale Carnegie</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Michael Gerber</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Eric Ries</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45">Mohnish Pabrai</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Mike Michalowicz</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Will Guidara</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Chris Voss</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Peter Thiel</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Simon Sinek</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Dale Carnegie</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Michael Gerber</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Eric Ries</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/45" aria-hidden="true">Mohnish Pabrai</span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE PLAN -->
<section class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:py-28" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="reveal mb-14 max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-fluid-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink2">Context before answers.</h2>
      <p class="text-fluid-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Most AI tools give you a blank box and wait for you to figure out what to ask. Earl starts differently, because the answers you get are only as useful as the context behind them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="reveal group rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card p-7 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-ink2/5">
        <div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gold/15 font-data text-lg font-bold text-golddark">01</div>
        <div class="mb-2 text-fluid-lg font-semibold text-ink2">Answer the interview first</div>
        <div class="text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Three stages, about twenty-five minutes in total, covering your business, your goals, your numbers, and what you are actually trying to build. Earl needs to know who you are before he can help you with anything.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal group rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card p-7 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-ink2/5">
        <div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gold/15 font-data text-lg font-bold text-golddark">02</div>
        <div class="mb-2 text-fluid-lg font-semibold text-ink2">Review your Navigation Chart</div>
        <div class="text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">When the interview is done, Earl produces a plain-language read of your specific situation: where the danger is, what to stop doing, where your leverage is, and what the next ninety days should focus on. Not theory. Your business.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal group rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card p-7 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-ink2/5">
        <div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gold/15 font-data text-lg font-bold text-golddark">03</div>
        <div class="mb-2 text-fluid-lg font-semibold text-ink2">Talk with Earl who already knows you</div>
        <div class="text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">From there, every conversation starts from what Earl learned about you. Bring any decision, any problem, any question you cannot shake. He asks before he answers and tracks every step you commit to between sessions.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal mt-12">
      <a href="/intake" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gold px-8 py-4 font-data text-sm tracking-[0.06em] text-dark shadow-lg shadow-gold/20 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-golddark">Start the free interview <span>&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- A LOOK INSIDE -->
<section class="border-t border-line bg-[#fffdf8] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:py-28" id="inside">
  <div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl reveal">
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-fluid-2xl font-bold text-ink2">See what it looks like.</h2>
    <p class="text-fluid-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">You learn who Earl is and where you are going first. That extra step is exactly what makes everything after it useful.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-bg shadow-md transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line px-4 py-2.5">
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5">
        <div class="mb-3 flex gap-1.5">
          <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-gold"></div>
          <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c8a96e 55%,#e0d8c8 55%)"></div>
          <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-fluid-base font-semibold text-ink2">Stage 2 of 3 &middot; Your numbers</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-fluid-sm text-ink/50">Question 11 of 13</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-line px-5 py-3 font-data text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.02em] text-ink/55">First, the interview. Earl learns who you are.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-bg shadow-md transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line px-4 py-2.5">
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-2 p-5">
        <div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-earl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[0.82rem] leading-snug text-ink">What specifically are you trying to fix this month?</div>
        <div class="ml-auto max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-ink2 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[0.82rem] leading-snug text-bg">Cash. We look profitable but we are always short.</div>
        <div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-earl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[0.82rem] leading-snug text-ink">Then we start with the gap between what you bill and what you bank.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-line px-5 py-3 font-data text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.02em] text-ink/55">Then you talk, and Earl already knows your business.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-bg shadow-md transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
      <div class="p-5">
